---
// src/components/AboutSection.astro
---

<div class="aboutCard">
  <p>
    Hello, I'm <strong class="name-text">Deepali</strong> and I mostly go around by the name <span class="accent-text">lavenderpeaches</span>.
    I like to code and build things in general and have been programming
    since the fall of 2022. I'm always open for having meaningful and
    fun conversations. If you check out my projects, don't forget to
    leave feedback—it's always dearly appreciated. Currently, I'm
    working as a <span class="subtle-text">backend dev</span> at a startup and looking for opportunities
    to grow.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .aboutCard {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 20, 45, 0.65), rgba(15, 15, 20, 0.85));
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
    border-radius: 24px;
    color: var(--text);
    height: 100%;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .aboutCard p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .name-text {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .accent-text {
    color: #c084fc;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .subtle-text {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>